1
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Kim Possible is a family, action, adventure film directed by Adam B. Stein.

2
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:34,000
Everyday teen hero Kim Possible and her best friend Ron Stoppable embark on their
freshman year of high school, all while saving the world from evil villains.

3
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
While Kim and Ron have always been one step ahead of their opponents, navigating the social
hierarchy of high school is more challenging than the action-hero ever imagined.

4
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:02,000
With Drakken and Shego lurking in the wings, Kim must rely on her family and Team
Possible—Ron, tech-genius Wade, new friend Athena, and Rufus, a Naked mole-rat.

5
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Kim Possible, played by Sadie Stanley.

6
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Ron Stoppable, played by Sean Giambrone.

7
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:14,000
Athena, played by Ciara Riley Wilson.

8
00:45:52,000 --> 00:45:58,000
Shego, played by Taylor Ortega.

9
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:42,000
Nana Possible, played by Connie Ray.

10
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
Wade, played by Issac Ryan Brown.

11
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
Kim Possible is a 2019 American action comedy television film that premiered as a
Disney Channel Original Movie on Disney Channel on February 15, 2019.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
Loosely based on the 2002–2007 animated series of the same name created by Mark McCorkle and Bob
Schooley, the film stars Sadie Stanley, Sean Giambrone, and Ciara Riley Wilson.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
The film explores themes of spy, genius, teenage girl, heroine, spy spoof.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is lighthearted.
